---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Aktivasi Kartu Nama NFC — Cardi Agent";
const description = "Aktivasi kartu nama NFC Cardi Smart Business Card.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} activeNav="cardimom">
<section class="hero hero-dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Aktivasi</span><h1>Aktifkan Cardi Smart Business Card.</h1><p class="lead">Hubungkan kartu nama NFC ke profil kamu.</p></div></div></section><section class="sec "><div class="wrap"><div class="split"><form class="form" data-wa-form data-wa-title="Aktivasi Cardi Smart Business Card" id="cardimom-activation">
<p class="form-intro">Isi data di bawah. Tim kami mengaktifkan kartu dan mengonfirmasi lewat WhatsApp.</p><div class="field"><label for="cardimom-activation-kode">Kode kartu *</label><input id="cardimom-activation-kode" name="kode" type="text" placeholder="contoh: CSB-000123" required></div><div class="field"><label for="cardimom-activation-nama">Nama lengkap *</label><input id="cardimom-activation-nama" name="nama" type="text" placeholder="" required></div><div class="field"><label for="cardimom-activation-jabatan">Jabatan &amp; perusahaan</label><input id="cardimom-activation-jabatan" name="jabatan" type="text" placeholder=""></div><div class="field"><label for="cardimom-activation-wa">Nomor WhatsApp *</label><input id="cardimom-activation-wa" name="wa" type="tel" placeholder="08xx" required></div><div class="field"><label for="cardimom-activation-link">Link profil / LinkedIn / website</label><input id="cardimom-activation-link" name="link" type="url" placeholder="https://"></div>
<button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit">Kirim aktivasi via WhatsApp</button>
<p class="form-note">Form ini membuka WhatsApp dengan pesan yang sudah terisi. Tidak ada data yang disimpan di situs.</p>
</form><div><div class="grid g1 "><article class="card "><div class="card-top"></div><h3>Langkah aktivasi</h3><ul class=checks><li>Temukan kode di belakang kartu</li><li>Isi form dan kirim via WhatsApp</li><li>Tunggu konfirmasi aktivasi</li><li>Tap kartu untuk mencoba</li></ul></article><article class="card "><div class="card-top"></div><h3>Butuh bantuan?</h3><p>Hubungi kami di WhatsApp 0812-8989-5646.</p><a class="card-link" href="/bantuan/">Pusat bantuan →</a></article></div></div></div></div></section>
</Layout>
